WEBVTT

NOTE
A demonstration caption track for the nocomponents video player. The text describes the
player's own features rather than transcribing the film.

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
This is a WebVTT track, passed in as a &lt;track&gt; child.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.000
The player draws these cues itself, so they can be styled and moved like anything else.

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Pick a different one from the settings menu, or turn them off.

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:24.000
The track list is read off the element, not passed in beside it.

5
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:31.000
So a track added or removed later needs nothing said about it.

6
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:39.000
Which is how they step up out of the way when the control bar comes back.
